        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Pairs 3: Lovely Birds</strong> invites you into a cozy world of feathered friends and peaceful landscapes. 🌿🐦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and find <strong>hidden birds</strong> and matching items in beautifully illustrated scenes. This charming twist on the classic hidden object genre lets you test your observation skills while enjoying a soothing and cozy gameplay experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943900/extras/d536ad9fb5dbbca8b8d6d0b29fb898ec.avif?t=1763340784\" width=1596 height=544 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌸 A Cozy Hidden Object Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovely Birds Everywhere</strong> 🐦 – Spot colorful parrots, tiny hummingbirds, and playful songbirds hidden among flowers, trees, and gardens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Pairs Puzzle</strong> 🔍 – Match adorable birds and related items to complete each scene. It’s a fresh take on hidden object games that blends relaxation with challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful Atmosphere</strong> 🌿 – Collect shimmering water drops and fluttering butterflies as you explore calm and cozy landscapes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎶 Relax and Unwind</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soothing Soundscapes</strong> 🎼 – Gentle background music and nature sounds create a cozy, meditative atmosphere perfect for unwinding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play at Your Own Pace</strong> 🕊️ – Enjoy relaxed puzzle-solving or test yourself with more challenging modes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh hidden object game with <strong>150+ cozy levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 unique pair-matchi